  "run-delete-duplicate-empty-lists-migration-confirm": "Wannan zai fara mayar da kowane jeri da aka raba zuwa jerin kowane layin iyo, sannan ya share jerin fanko da suke da wani jeri mai take ɗaya da ya ƙunshi katuna. Jerin fanko masu maimaituwa na gaske kawai za a cire. A ci gaba?",
