  "password-length-first-login": "Shiga na farko",
  "password-length-fixed": "An gyara",
  "password-length-from-environment": "Ƙimar da aka saita a muhallin saba tana aiki; ajiyewa a nan zai maye gurbinta.",
  "password-length-last-login": "Shiga na ƙarshe",
  "password-length-login-count": "Sau nawa aka shiga",
  "password-length-no-results": "Babu asusu a nan.",
  "password-length-report-desc": "Asusun da suka shiga da kalmar sirri wadda ta gaza mafi ƙarancin tsawo. Mai bincike kaɗai ya san tsawon kalmar sirri, don haka yana ba da rahoton gajeriya bayan shiga; kalmar sirri da tsawonta ba sa barin sa. An gyara yana nufin lokacin da aka sauya kalmar sirrin asusun - asusun da ya sake shiga da gajeriyar kalmar sirri ana sake nuna shi a matsayin gajere sosai.",
  "password-length-saved": "An ajiye.",
  "password-min-length": "Mafi ƙarancin tsawon kalmar sirri",
  "password-min-length-description": "Ana jera shiga da gajeriyar kalmar sirri a ƙasa. Ba a taɓa hana shiga saboda haka ba.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Tilasta mafi ƙarancin tsawo",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "Ana ƙin sabuwar kalmar sirri mafi gajarta, kuma asusun da ya shiga da gajeriyar kalmar sirri dole ne ya sauya ta kafin komai. Sauya ta yana fitar da kowane zama na asusun. Kalmomin sirri na LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS da Sandstorm na masu samar da su ne, kuma ba a duba su.",
  "password-change-required-text": "Wannan shafin yanzu yana buƙatar kalmomin sirri na aƙalla haruffa __min__, kuma naka ya fi gajarta. Zaɓi mafi tsawo don ci gaba. Daga nan za a fitar da kowane zama na asusunka, kuma za ka sake shiga da sabuwar kalmar sirri.",
  "date-format-for-everyone": "Tsarin kwanan wata ga kowa",
  "calendar-system": "Tsarin kalanda (nuna kwanan wata)",
  "show-unread-changes": "Yi alama a katunan da suka canza tun lokacin da na buɗe su na ƙarshe",
  "show-unread-changes-desc": "Katin da take, bayani, kwanaki, lakabobi, mambobi, jerin dubawa, haɗe-haɗe ko sharhinsa suka canza bayan ka buɗe shi na ƙarshe zai sami gefen shuɗi a ƙaramin katinsa, har sai ka buɗe shi.",
  "keep-title-tags": "Ajiye #alama da @mamba a cikin taken sababbin katuna",
  "keep-title-tags-description": "Idan ka zaɓi alama da # ko mamba da @ yayin da kake rubuta taken sabon kati, a ajiye wannan rubutun a cikin take ma. A kashe: alamar ko mamban za su maye gurbin rubutun.",
  "show-focus-outline": "Nuna layin maida hankali",
  "keep-add-card-form-open": "Bar fom ɗin ƙara kati a buɗe bayan an ƙara kati",
  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "A kunne: bayan an ƙara kati, fom ɗin zai kasance a buɗe da take mara komai don kati na gaba. A kashe: fom ɗin zai rufe da zarar an ƙara katin.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Mayar da [alama] a farkon taken sabon kati zuwa alama",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "Idan taken sabon kati ya fara da [Rubutu] sannan wani rubutu ya biyo baya, Rubutu zai zama alamar katin (za a ƙirƙira shi idan allon ba shi da alama mai wannan suna) kuma za a cire shi daga take. A kashe: take zai kasance yadda yake.",
  "submit-on-enter": "Aika daga masu gyara da Enter",
  "submit-on-enter-description": "Idan yana kunne, danna Enter yana adana sunan kati, bayani da sauran masu gyara na cikin layi; Shift+Enter yana saka sabon layi. Idan yana kashe, Ctrl/Cmd+Enter yana adanawa kuma Enter yana saka sabon layi.",
  "open-many-cards-at-once": "Buɗe katuna da yawa lokaci guda",
  "open-many-cards-at-once-description": "Bar kowane katin da ka danna a buɗe cikin tagarsa. Idan wannan a kashe yake, danna kati zai rufe wanda yake buɗe.",
  "checklist-ding-sound": "Kunna sauti idan an kammala abu a jerin duba",
  "checklist-ding-sound-description": "Yana kunna gajeren sauti idan ka duba abu a jerin duba. An kashe shi tun da farko.",
